   "text": {
    "L1": "The National War Memorial honours brave soldiers who gave their lives.",
    "L2": "Its eternal flame is not only a light. It stands for our never-ending memory and respect.",
    "L3": "Each name is etched, or carved, so no soldier is forgotten.",
    "L4": "Battlefields, skies and wide oceans show the army, air force and navy serving side by side.",
    "L5": "Because the poem remembers sacrifice, we should read it slowly and respectfully.",
    "L6": "One rhyming couplet uses the words wide and side.",
    "L7": "Let us always remember their sacrifice and honour their courage."
   },
